                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "79c7173a-e107-362f-8e7e-732b8635dc5c",
                        "entry_id": "622d85fa-2c85-3031-becd-6eeefdd2ae16",
                        "glosses": [
                            "voluntarism (a doctrine that prioritizes the will over emotion or reason)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a4e88c85-66b5-4881-aa52-9e77b6d02807",
                                "sense_id": "79c7173a-e107-362f-8e7e-732b8635dc5c",
                                "text": "Радика́льный рационали́зм субъективи́зма привёл к не ме́нее радика́льному волюнтари́зму, т. е. иррационали́зму.",
                                "translation": "The radical rationalism of subjectivism has led to a no less radical voluntarism, which is to say, to irrationalism.",
                                "english": "The radical rationalism of subjectivism has led to a no less radical voluntarism, which is to say, to irrationalism."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "36b6f4b9-af40-3d10-8f08-be00352cc9e9",
                        "entry_id": "622d85fa-2c85-3031-becd-6eeefdd2ae16",
                        "glosses": [
                            "arbitrariness, subjective decision making"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4ad03d64-64ad-4087-aed7-018f9d4a27de",
                                "sense_id": "36b6f4b9-af40-3d10-8f08-be00352cc9e9",
                                "text": "Мне так показа́лось, мне, дире́ктору, так захоте́лось; мне, дире́ктору, нет де́ла до того́, что ду́мают други́е. Вот э́то и есть, говори́т, волюнтари́зм, то́ есть хулига́нство.",
                                "translation": "I thought so, and I, the manager, wished so; I, the manager, could not care less about what others think. And that, he says, is exactly what arbitrariness, which is to say hooliganism, is.",
                                "english": "I thought so, and I, the manager, wished so; I, the manager, could not care less about what others think. And that, he says, is exactly what arbitrariness, which is to say hooliganism, is."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
